Workflow adaptation

Adapted by Mancuso Lab (2026) from Scientific Software Playbook:
https://github.com/mancusolab/scientific-software-playbook
Source lineage: ed3dai/ed3d-plugins and obra/superpowers (Jesse Vincent).
Changes: consolidated Codex-only workflows, proportional planning and review,
no scientific pipeline or runtime adapter dependencies.
